# Adapted from Aurum's chapter aurum-druid/dalaran-finale (Aurums Night Elf Druid Guide 0.4.37,
# GPL-3.0). Changes: for every class, Stormwind pickups moved before the trip, no fixed reward
# choice, shorter tips. Ids cross-checked against Polestar 0.3.2's reference data and Dungeons
# codex and the MittenQuest Forever pack (Stormwind 31-35). Untested in game (Aurum: past 20).
guide groupe-alliance/12-dalaran
title Group 11 · City of Dalaran (dungeon 30-33, optional)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 30-33
zone Stormwind City
next groupe-alliance/14-paluns-hautebrande

# Groupe Alliance 0.5.0: the end of the Defias story in Stormwind (393 to 396, Seal of Wrynn),
# only for whoever finished the Stockade chain (The Curious Visitor, 392, in 08b-prison).
# Ids, givers and places from Polestar's Forever data; event tips from Wowhead Forever comments
# (October and November 2026), rewritten.

step Stormwind: the end of the Defias story
  when turnedin 392
  tip Only if you did The Stockade Riots. Baros Alexston is in the City Hall on Cathedral Square, Mathias Shaw upstairs at SI:7 in Old Town, Elling Trias upstairs in the cheese shop of the Trade District, Tyrion in the garden beside Stormwind Keep.
  accept 393                              -- Baros Alexston
  turnin 393                              -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 350
  turnin 350                              -- Elling Trias
  accept 2745
  turnin 2745                             -- Tyrion
  accept 2746

step Clara's apples
  when onquest 2746
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip The bowl of apples sits on the table of the farmhouse just outside the Stormwind gate, south-west of the road. Silk Cloth: from your bags, humanoids or the Auction House.
  collect 8683 x2 quest 2746 @33.95,57.16 -- Clara's Fresh Apple
  collect 4306 x3 quest 2746              -- Silk Cloth

step The Attack!
  when onquest 2746
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 2746                             -- Tyrion
  accept 434
  complete 434 @72.36,35.12               -- Overhear Lescovar and Marzon in the garden, then kill both

step Brotherhood's End
  when onquest 434
  turnin 434                              -- Elling Trias
  accept 394
  turnin 394                              -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 395
  turnin 395                              -- Baros Alexston
  accept 396
  turnin 396                              -- Lady Katrana Prestor, in the throne room of Stormwind Keep: Seal of Wrynn

# Groupe Alliance 0.7.0: the dungeon is optional, like the other chapters: asked once at the
# first dungeon pickup (`when group 92456`, Polestar's "Skip it / Do it with a group" banner),
# every later dungeon step needs it done (`when done dal-start`). Skipped: the end of the Defias
# story above stays, then the guide sends the player back to Menethil Harbor. An Alarming
# Request (92432) is still taken in Southshore and handed in near Dalaran by the next guides
# (14-paluns-hautebrande, 18-arathi): it is a plain errand, not the dungeon.

step Stormwind: two dungeon quests
  label dal-start
  when group 92456
  tip City of Dalaran: a 5-player Forever dungeon in the Alterac Mountains, best at 30 to 33. This chapter takes its four quests, runs the dungeon, then hands them in. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to the Wetlands.
  note Group: level 30 required for An Alarming Request, the quest that opens the way to Dalaran. Below 30? Level up first.
  tip Shylamiir is in the Trade District, High Sorcerer Andromath in the Mage Quarter tower.
  accept 92456
  accept 92489

step Southshore: Emissary Jacques
  when done dal-start
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip From Stormwind: use your hearthstone (Deepwater Tavern, Menethil Harbor) or fly to Menethil Harbor, then take the boat to Southshore. His quest needs level 30: below that, the guide waits here. Ahead of the others? Take it, they can take it from him later on their own.
  level 30
  getfp "Southshore"
  accept 92432

step Image of Archmage Modera
  when done dal-start
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip North-west past Hillsbrad Fields, by Dalaran's outer sewer. Avoid Tarren Mill.
  turnin 92432
  accept 92457
  accept 92458

step City of Dalaran entrance
  when done dal-start
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Group of 5. Open the sewer gate with the key from Modera and follow the large pipe.
  goto 14.7,63 "City of Dalaran" r 25

step Inside the dungeon
  when done dal-start
  tip Blossom in the central garden, remnants everywhere, the Arcane Mote at the Violet Citadel end.
  note Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  complete 92456
  complete 92489
  complete 92457
  complete 92458

# Groupe Alliance 0.6.1: no Stormwind trip after the dungeon. The next guide starts at the
# Deepwater Tavern, where the hearthstone is bound (Thousand Needles guide), and stops in Stormwind
# later on (14-paluns-hautebrande): A Green Sample and Power Overwhelming are handed in there.

step Modera's rewards
  when done dal-start
  zone Silverpine Forest
  turnin 92457
  turnin 92458
  note Next: Menethil Harbor, where your hearthstone is still bound (Deepwater Tavern). Shylamiir and High Sorcerer Andromath take their quests at the next guide's Stormwind stop.

step Dalaran skipped: back to Menethil Harbor
  when !group 92456
  zone Wetlands
  tip Use your hearthstone (Deepwater Tavern, Menethil Harbor), or fly from Stormwind to Menethil Harbor if it is on cooldown.
  goto 10.7,61.0 "Deepwater Tavern"
